sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  actor Admin
  participant Mobile as Expo Mobile App
  participant Gateway as API Gateway
  participant SupportService as Support Service
  participant SupportDb as notification_and_support
  participant AdminService as Admin Service

  User->>Mobile: Open support form
  Mobile->>Gateway: POST /v1/support/tickets
  Gateway->>Gateway: Validate bearer token
  Gateway->>SupportService: POST /internal/support/tickets
  SupportService->>SupportDb: Insert support ticket
  SupportDb-->>SupportService: SupportTicketSummary
  SupportService-->>Gateway: SupportTicketSummary
  Gateway-->>Mobile: Created support ticket

  Admin->>Gateway: GET /v1/admin/support/tickets
  Gateway->>AdminService: GET /internal/admin/support/tickets
  AdminService->>SupportService: GET /internal/admin/support/tickets
  SupportService->>SupportDb: Read support queue
  SupportDb-->>SupportService: Tickets
  SupportService-->>AdminService: Tickets
  AdminService-->>Gateway: Tickets
  Gateway-->>Admin: Ticket queue

  Admin->>Gateway: PATCH /v1/admin/support/tickets/:id/status
  Gateway->>AdminService: PATCH internal admin ticket status
  AdminService->>SupportService: PATCH internal support ticket status
  SupportService->>SupportDb: Update status
  SupportDb-->>SupportService: Updated ticket
  Gateway-->>Admin: Updated ticket
